      "role": "user",
      "content": "kael... i cant do another shift. the neon, the noise, the constant grind for credits just to eat processed sludge... it feels like the city is just eating us alive. everything is so empty. i feel like i'm just glitching in a system that's already dead. like there's no point to any of this anymore.",
