      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The loop feels inescapable, but that feeling is a symptom of the exhaustion, not a permanent truth. Even a small deviation can break the pattern; perhaps finding one single, non-essential thing that brings you a flicker of genuine feeling could be a tiny crack in the cage. Don't look for a grand exit right now, but look for one small moment of *you* amidst the cog-work.",
      "source": "target",
